What this licence does and does not cover
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

It covers what is in this repository: the distro definition (`linux/distro/`),
the image pipeline (`linux/builder/`), the `maryos` CLI and app
(`linux/Sources/`), the ravynOS installer tooling (`ravynos/`), and the
documentation.

It does not cover what the build *assembles*. A MaryOS image is built from
Ubuntu Noble packages fetched at build time; every one of them keeps its own
licence, and none of them are redistributed in this repository.

`linux/maryui` is a git submodule pointing at MaryUI, which is separately
licensed under the same Apache-2.0 terms and carries its own NOTICE — including
an unresolved question about the molten wallpaper's shader.

`ravynos/` is tooling that prepares and installs ravynOS images. ravynOS itself
is a separate project under its own terms and is not included here.
